  {
   "name": "Doubling Season",
   "status": "planned",
   "why": "About $33–45. Doubles tokens and counters, so every Zaxara trigger makes two tokens with double counters. Already in The Astonishing Ant-Man, so move it or buy a second copy. Swap for Ironscale Hydra."
  },
  {
   "name": "Green Sun's Zenith",
   "status": "planned",
   "why": "About $32. Finds any green creature directly onto the battlefield. Already listed in Tom's Bombs. Swap for Rishkar's Expertise."
  },
  {
   "name": "Finale of Devastation",
   "status": "planned",
   "why": "About $27. Tutor plus a team-wide pump at X=10. Already listed in Tom's Bombs. Swap for Overrun."
  },
  {
   "name": "Craterhoof Behemoth",
   "status": "planned",
   "why": "About $19. The best one-card finisher here. Already in The Astonishing Ant-Man. Swap for End-Raze Forerunners."
  },
  {
   "name": "Unbound Flourishing",
   "status": "planned",
   "why": "About $16. The top pickup: doubles X on permanents and copies X instants and sorceries. Put its trigger above Zaxara's on the stack, so it resolves first. Copied X spells deal double, so Exsanguinate at X=20 hits for 40. Swap for Stumpsquall Hydra."
  },
  {
   "name": "Heroic Intervention",
   "status": "planned",
   "why": "About $15. Best protection against a board wipe. Already in several family decks. Swap for Tamiyo's Safekeeping."
  },
  {
   "name": "Kalonian Hydra",
   "status": "planned",
   "why": "About $14. Doubles counters every attack, and Gargos makes it {G}{G}. Swap for Benevolent Hydra."
  }
