 "name": "Gargos: Hydra Tribal",
 "notes": [
  "Plan: ramp to six, land Gargos, then every other Hydra costs {4} less, so X Hydras get absurd.",
  "Budget build: the list swaps out 7 cards priced above $10. They now sit in Cards to add with prices and their replacements. Prices are rough Nov 2026 web listings, so recheck them before buying.",
  "Whenever one of your creatures is targeted by a spell, Gargos fights a creature you don't control. Yours or an opponent's spell both count, so cheap tricks are removal: Snakeskin Veil, Tamiyo's Safekeeping, Solidarity of Heroes, Hunter's Insight, Bite Down.",
  "Freed from the Real and Pemmin's Aura are blue, so neither is legal here. They live in the Zaxara deck.",
  "Season of Growth draws a card each time you target your own creature, on top of the Gargos fight.",
  "Finish with End-Raze Forerunners, Overwhelming Stampede or Overrun. Lifeblood Hydra and Goldvein Hydra refill you if they die.",
  "Most Hydras here also appear in the Zaxara list, so building both needs two copies of each shared card."
 ],
